	(602, 60, 3, 'heeeehaha', 1, '2026-08-14 18:14:11', '2026-08-14 18:14:11', 0),
	(603, 60, 43, 'hmm', 1, '2026-08-14 18:14:16', '2026-08-14 18:14:17', 0),
	(610, 61, 44, 'Hello can you tell me about the website?', 1, '2026-08-20 13:27:18', '2026-08-20 13:49:55', 0),
	(611, 61, NULL, 'Visitor navigated to: http://localhost/harpercollins/index.php', 1, '2026-08-20 13:29:59', '2026-08-20 13:29:59', 0),
	(612, 61, NULL, 'Hello! Welcome to HarperCollins\' website! We\'re thrilled to have you here. Our website is dedicated to bringing you the latest news, releases, and exclusive content from HarperCollins, a leading publisher of books, audiobooks, and e-books. On our site, you can:\n\n* Browse our latest releases and bestsellers across various genres\n* Discover new authors and books through our featured sections\n* Learn more about our authors and their work through our author pages\n* Find upcoming events and book signings near you\n* Sign up for our Bookperk newsletter to receive daily bookish finds, fantastic deals, and more!\n\nWe\'re constantly updating our website with new content, so be sure to check back often for the latest updates. If you have any specific questions or need assistance with anything, feel free to ask, and I\'ll be happy to help!', 0, '2026-08-20 13:30:06', '2026-08-20 13:30:06', 1),
	(613, 61, 44, 'do you have any packages on this website?', 1, '2026-08-20 13:31:06', '2026-08-20 13:49:55', 0),
	(614, 61, NULL, 'Unfortunately, we don\'t have any specific packages listed on our website. Our focus is on showcasing our latest releases, bestsellers, and author information. However, we do offer a variety of books and audiobooks for sale, and you can browse our catalog to find something that suits your interests!\n\nIf you\'re looking for a specific package or bundle, I can suggest checking out our deals and promotions page. We often feature special offers, discounts, and bundles on certain titles or series. You can also sign up for our Bookperk newsletter, which provides daily bookish finds, fantastic deals, and more!\n\nIf you have any further questions or would like more information on a specific book or author, please feel free to ask, and I\'ll be happy to help!', 0, '2026-08-20 13:32:11', '2026-08-20 13:32:11', 1),
	(615, 61, 44, 'do you have book to recommend?', 1, '2026-08-20 13:39:43', '2026-08-20 13:49:55', 0),
	(616, 61, NULL, 'I\'d be happy to recommend some books based on your interests! However, I\'d like to know a bit more about what you\'re in the mood for. Are you looking for a:\n\n* Thrilling mystery?\n* Heartwarming romance?\n* Action-packed sci-fi?\n* Thought-provoking non-fiction?\n* Or something else entirely?\n\nLet me know, and I can give you some personalized book recommendations!', 0, '2026-08-20 13:42:22', '2026-08-20 13:42:22', 1),
	(617, 61, 44, 'okay thank you', 1, '2026-08-20 13:42:38', '2026-08-20 13:49:55', 0),
	(618, 61, NULL, 'You\'re welcome! I\'d be happy to recommend some books based on your interests. Since you didn\'t specify a particular genre, I\'ll suggest a few popular titles across different categories. Keep in mind that these are just a few examples, and there are many more great books out there!\n\n1. **Fiction**: "My Thoughts Have Wings" by Maggie Smith and Leanne Hatch - A heartwarming story about friendship and self-discovery.\n2. **Mystery**: "Everyone on This Train Is a Suspect" by Benjamin Stevenson - A gripping thriller about a murder investigation on a train.\n3. **Romance**: "Fangirl Down" by Tessa Bailey - A fun and flirty romance about a woman who\'s trying to find love again.\n4. **Non-Fiction**: "Be a Revolution" by Ijeoma Oluo - A thought-provoking book about social justice and activism.\n\nThese are just a few examples, and there are many more great books out there! If you\'d like more recommendations or have specific preferences, feel free to let me know!', 0, '2026-08-20 13:44:13', '2026-08-20 13:44:13', 1),
	(619, 61, NULL, 'Visitor navigated to: http://localhost/harpercollins/index.php', 1, '2026-08-20 13:44:44', '2026-08-20 13:44:44', 0),
	(620, 61, 44, 'okay', 1, '2026-08-20 13:46:04', '2026-08-20 13:49:55', 0),
